  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investigating the market and pathway for scaling Nexus, a cost-effective water utility management software for planning and managing sustainable and climate-smart water services, within Ghana&#x2019;s peri-u</narrative>
  </title>
  <description akvo:type="4" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovate: Drinking Water</narrative>
  </description>
  <description akvo:type="5" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nexus is a promising solution that leverages digitization to catalyze providers&#x2019; ability to deliver sustainable and resilient water services within peri-urban and rural areas. Our innovative cloud-based management software is designed to revolutionize the planning, design, construction and operation of water services on a scalable level.&#xa0;This economical solution empowers providers and their partners to optimize core operations by digitizing their workflows and integrating hyperlocal geospatial data, quantified resilience measurements, and real-time analytics all in one accessible platform.</narrative>
  </description>
